            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "ObKah",
              "x": 20,
              "y": 46,
              "name": "观察一",
              "fill": "#6F7891",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 310,
              "content": "1. 你最容易失控的时间点，还是在“本来想停下，但又多刷了 20-30 分钟”的那段。",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "$font-weight-regular"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "j8vRd",
              "x": 20,
              "y": 92,
              "name": "观察二",
              "fill": "#6F7891",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 310,
              "content": "2. 一旦第二天起床没完全乱掉，你后面两天就更容易重新回到阈值内。",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "$font-weight-regular"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "rq4mM",
              "x": 20,
              "y": 138,
              "name": "观察三",
              "fill": "#6F7891",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 310,
              "content": "3. 刷手机不是根因本身，它更像你晚睡链条里最后那一下放不下的动作。",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "$font-weight-regular"
            }
          ]
        },
